{"id":"wb-8-720","name":"畹町桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"畹町桥","text":"畹町桥（傣那语：ᥑᥨᥝᥴ ᥝᥢᥰ ᥖᥥᥒ），又称畹九桥，位于中国云南省德宏傣族景颇族自治州畹町镇，跨越畹町河连接缅甸棒赛（九谷），是中国与缅甸之间的界河桥，第二次世界大战时期中国远征军自畹町桥入缅抗战，现为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%95%B9%E7%94%BA%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":92831968,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92831968","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1f7e3c94960892c9127d6f32.jpg","title":"畹町桥_-_2025-11-03_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%95%B9%E7%94%BA%E6%A1%A5_-_2025-11-03_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/%E7%95%B9%E7%94%BA%E6%A1%A5_-_2025-11-03_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​中缅国界畹町桥","width":320,"height":213}}